    {
      "id": "claim_7a22369f25634424a18e1db615358ae2",
      "statement": "The tool registry is a module-level dict; execute_tool returns None for unknown tools and catches TypeError to return {\"error\": str(e)}, so a bad model tool call cannot crash the runtime cycle.",
