      "id": "claim_55014dc3f6a14347ba76a5186cd69473",
      "statement": "Memory is file-backed (history.json) with two policies: truncate keeps the last max_turns*2 messages, summarize keeps the same window verbatim plus a single system-role message prefixed 'Resumo da conversa anterior:' (customizable via a pluggable SummarizerFn used by mem0_hook.py); apply_window dispatches on RuntimeConfig.memory_policy.",
